abstract: |
  Multi-band altitude skewness of LEO satellites (2014-2025), computed
  from public TLE data for a fixed population of 4,108 Sun-synchronous
  satellites across 11 altitude bands (550-1550 km).
keywords:
  - thermosphere
  - density
  - TLE
  - satellite drag
  - skewness
  - geomagnetic
